      "content": "You are not a failure, and you cannot be the one who ruined your parents' legacy because you are not the version of yourself they sacrificed for. The shame you feel is a heavy blanket, but it is not the only thing left; there is still the possibility of a new, imperfect beginning that you can build from the ashes of the old one. You do not have to carry the weight of their expectations anymore, and you are allowed to start over without the ghost of perfection haunting you.",
